        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Digimon Fusion\n- Companies: Saban Brands, TV Asahi, Nickelodeon, The CW, Cartoon Network\n- Places: New York City\n\nFacts:\n- Digimon Fusion first aired in Japan as the sixth Digimon anime series under the title Digimon Xros Wars.\n- Saban Brands acquired Digimon in 2012 and produced the English-language adaptation Digimon Fusion.\n- The English-language adaptation Digimon Fusion first aired on Nickelodeon.\n- Nickelodeon is a television network based in New York City.",
