        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Digimon Fusion\n- Companies: Nickelodeon, Viacom, Viacom Media Networks\n- Places: United States, New York City\n- Topics: television networks, broadcasting\n\nFacts:\n- Nickelodeon launched on December 1, 1977, as an American basic cable and satellite television network.\n- Viacom owns Nickelodeon through Viacom Media Networks.\n- Nickelodeon is based in New York City.\n- Nickelodeon is often shortened to Nick.\n- Nickelodeon aired Digimon Fusion in the United States on September 7, 2013.",
